<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 85,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 85,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friday's actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog marketings were 85,000 head, compared with the estimate of 95,000, USDA said.</p>
<p>Saturday's actual receipts were 24,000 head, compared with an estimated 25,000.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales of Barrows and Gilts were steady-up $0.50 from midsession on Friday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
